what's up everybody my name is clinton  jones and if you're a 3d artist or  wanting to get into 3d art i have got  just the thing for you every six months  for the last two years i've challenged  artists to create epic 3d renders from  simple bare-bones project files and  teamed up with my favorite companies to  give away next level prizes over the  last two years our passion for 3d art  and digital storytelling have  consistently brought us together to  build some of the coolest 3d montages on  the internet and have pushed us far  beyond our perceived capabilities today  marks the beginning of a new opportunity  to level up together and i'm proud to  present the moving meditations 3d  community challenge where through the  month of august i am challenging you to  put your passion to the test download  the template project file below and fill  it with the coolest 3d scene you can  imagine now this challenge is special  because i teamed up with tai chi master  luju chang known for his work on movies  like chongqi and mana tai chi and we  recorded 27 unique moves so you can  choose your favorite and drop it into  your scene because in september i'm  piecing every single submission together  to form an incredible martial arts mega  montage it doesn't matter if this is  your first 3d challenge or your first  week in 3d this challenge is open to  everybody looking to learn and grow in  their passion for digital art you can  use whatever program you want and i'll  be alongside you guys every step of the  way during this challenge but before i  go any further let's talk about these  prizes because if you've done these  challenges before you know we got some  good prizes and this one is no exception  because i teamed up with some of my  favorite companies in the  post-production space to build the  biggest international prize pool so far  now usually we just award prizes to the  top five artists but for the first time  ever if your render gets featured in the  top 100 montage kit bash 3d is stepping  up to give each of those 100 artists  their choice at any kit bash kit they  want and if you don't know what kit bash  is get hyped because they create the  highest quality themed 3d kits on the  market each kit comes with a total of  100 plus buildings props and assets  making digital world building an  absolute joy kit bash has a huge  selection of kits like neo san francisco  outlaw dmz manhattan elysium soviet  blocks outpost guya favelas treasure  island valhalla goliath city streets  aftermath dark fantasy medieval market  and roman empire just to name a few i've  used their assets for a long time now  they support nearly every software and  are offering challenge exclusive  discount codes during my live streams in  august now let's talk about the top five  prizes for the fourth and fifth place  artists you're winning an extra two kit  bash kits of your choice on behalf of  kit bash 3d to help round out that 3d  toolkit as well as a perpetual license  to davinci resolve studio by black magic  design davinci resolve studio is my  go-to non-linear editor of choice i  switched over from adobe premiere while  working at corridor and i hadn't looked  back since not only is there a super  powerful free version of the program  it's streamlined constantly updated and  is the industry standard software when  it comes to their coloring tools the  studio version however comes with added  ai tools presets quality of life  features and near unlimited resolution  and export caps i use davinci studio for  every video i cut and use it to quickly  add music sound effects or color to my  3d exports but what if your render comes  in third place  your choice of three kid bash kits yup  you're getting that the perpetual  davinci resolve studio license yup that  is yours as well  as well as a wacom intuos pro tablet  from the good people at wacom now you  have heard me say this before but i  cannot stress enough how much i love  these tablets first off they save your  dang wrist from the pain and long-term  damage a traditional mouse will do to  your brittle bones i want to be able to  do this for a long time but the tablet's  not just for drawing and sculpting  either i do everything short of playing  pc games with this thing it's got a ton  of shortcut buttons to speed up your  workflow comes with both software and  hardware for customizing your tablet  experience and of course supports pen  pressure and tilt controls for drawing  and sculpting we comes also letting the  winners choose their preferred tablet  size too as usual medium works best for  me but hey you know maybe you guys want  to go for that large  it's up to you but if your render finds  itself all the way into second place  you're getting the three kit fast 3d  kits the davinci studio license the way  common tools pro tablet and the new and  improved smart suit pro 2 from our good  friends at ricoco having a mocap suit  changes the game when it comes to  animation and world building in general  because it saves you so much time and  opens up a wide range of possibilities  for your 3d art you're not limited to  the free animations on miximo anymore v  tubing can be a thing and the time saved  hand animating characters from scratch  is worth everything and the grand prize  for the best render of them all will  receive the three kit bash kits davinci  studio the wacom intuos pro tablet and a  full performance capture bundle from  rococo complete with a smartsuit pro two  a pair of smart gloves to make hand  tracking super easy a face capture body  mount a one year subscription to their  upgraded software studio plus complete  with their face tracking add-on i used  rococo's suit and gloves to capture all  the animation for this challenge as well  as their studio software to help clean  up the animations i cannot thank rococo  kit bash wacom and blackmagic design  enough for coming together to provide  you guys with such an awesome and useful  collection of prizes for you to create  with  so to get started download the project  files below inside you'll find the  template project file which we've built  out for most major softwares you'll open  one up to see an animated camera and a  center framed character also included in  the project folder are the very  important 27 unique character animations  choose your favorite one swap it for the  stand-in character and begin building  your scene the rules are super simple  rule number one do not touch the camera  rule number two  replace the stand-in animation with your  favorite animation and don't move them  around the scene replace it exactly  and that's it  from there it's up to you and your  imagination to run wild with the  character and the environment and to  best help you on your creative journey  this month and to stay updated on every  facet of this challenge hop into my  discord server linked below it's where  you can download the starter files read  the rules faqs and technical details  myself and the moderators build out the  discord every single time we do these  challenges and it's where the entire  community will be during the challenge  to support each other get feedback on  their art and ask questions  the deadline the deadline the deadline  is  the deadline is august 28th at 11 59 pm  pst that is august 28th 11 59 pm pst and  i'll announce the submission link on  saturday the 13th on my live stream and  to keep judging fair and unbiased i'll  be joined by mystery guest judges on my  september 3rd live stream where we'll  reveal the top 100 and announce the top  five winners so get hyped download the  starter project files come hang out on  discord with us and challenge yourself  this month with the moving meditations  3d community challenge i'll see you next  saturday august 6th where i'm kicking  off my piece of 3d art for this  challenge in unreal engine 5. i am so  excited to learn and grow with everybody  this month and i can't wait to see what  